/* Verdict of the runtime health check of 'ojd diagnose --soak' when too few samples were taken. %1$.1f is the resident size in MiB, %2$.1f is the footprint in MiB, %3$lld is the number of open file descriptors, %4$.1f is the CPU load in percent and %5$.0f is the sampling time in seconds. The double percent sign prints one percent sign. */
