"status.controllerOwner.nameOnly" = "En uso por %@. El control se lee directamente. OpenJoystickDriver lo atiende en cuanto se libera.";
/* Says that another app uses the USB interface of a controller exclusively and that OpenJoystickDriver serves the controller when the app releases it, when the interface names no holder, in the controller detail and the controller list. */
"status.controllerOwner.unnamed" = "En uso por otra app. El control se lee directamente. OpenJoystickDriver lo atiende en cuanto se libera.";
